sequenceDiagram

  participant 4 as Salesforce<br />[Software System]
  participant 55 as Salesforce API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3030]
  participant 63 as ASM Storage API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 8 as Cloud Storage<br />[Software System]
  participant 7 as Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL<br />[Software System]

  4->>55: Requests a token and submits a document operation<br />[HTTPS, OAuth/JWT]
  55->>63: Writes the document or managed-user registry object<br />[HTTP/REST, X-Api-Key]
  63->>8: Stores the binary and manifest<br />[GCS API over HTTPS]
  55->>7: Persists repository, folder, document, and version metadata<br />[PostgreSQL on 127.0.0.1:5432]